      "description": "Row with a four-stop journey line filling as Arr works.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-item\"><span class=\"ds-tile\">DU</span><div class=\"ds-what\"><h3>Dune</h3><p>Movie &middot; 42% downloaded</p><ol class=\"ds-j\"><i class=\"ds-fill\"></i><li class=\"on\">Found</li><li class=\"on cur\">Downloading</li><li>Checking</li><li>In Plex</li></ol></div></div>",
      "css": ":host{--bg:#fff8ef;--card:#fff;--ink:#23302f;--muted:#566563;--line:#eadfce;--teal:#1c8576;--teal-ink:#17766a;--on-teal:#fff;--coral:#ff7a5c;--coral-ink:#a8331a;--sun-bg:#fff1c9;--sun-ink:#6b4c00;--ring:#0b5fff}.ds-item{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;background:var(--card);border:2px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:12px;color:var(--ink);font:500 15px Nunito,ui-rounded,system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-what{flex:1;min-width:0}.ds-what h3{margin:0;font-size:16px;font-weight:800}.ds-what p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}.ds-tile{width:46px;height:68px;border-radius:10px;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#fff;font-weight:800;background:linear-gradient(#3f6b8f,#16263a)}.ds-j{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:8px 0 0;position:relative;height:36px}.ds-j::before,.ds-fill{content:'';position:absolute;left:5px;right:5px;top:4px;height:3px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--line)}.ds-fill{background:var(--teal);transform-origin:left;transform:scaleX(.45)}.ds-j li{position:absolute;top:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:4px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--muted)}.ds-j li::before{content:'';width:11px;height:11px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid var(--teal);background:var(--card)}.ds-j li.on::before{background:var(--teal)}.ds-j li.cur{color:var(--ink);font-weight:800}.ds-j li:nth-of-type(1){left:0;align-items:flex-start}.ds-j li:nth-of-type(2){left:33.333%;transform:translateX(-50%)}.ds-j li:nth-of-type(3){left:66.666%;transform:translateX(-50%)}.ds-j li:nth-of-type(4){right:0;align-items:flex-end}"
    },
